      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Region Genie: Flux.2 dev\n\nFlux.2 has no layout format: the Separate button ties each prompt to its region by attention (it turns on by itself).\n\nFlux.2 dev uses guidance (4) instead of a negative prompt, so scene_prompt_negative is not used.\n\n**Model files** (pick your own in the loaders if yours are named differently):\n- [flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models`\n- [mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders`\n- [full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder/resolve/main/full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors) → `models/vae`\n\nManual: https://github.com/TheGhostOfSmittyWerbenjagermanjensen/ComfyUI-Region-Genie"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Region Genie: Flux.2 dev\n\nFlux.2 has no layout format: the Separate button ties each prompt to its region by attention (it turns on by itself).\n\nFlux.2 dev uses guidance (4) instead of a negative prompt, so scene_prompt_negative is not used.\n\n**Model files** (pick your own in the loaders if yours are named differently):\n- [flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models`\n- [mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders`\n- [full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder/resolve/main/full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors) → `models/vae`\n\nManual: https://github.com/TheGhostOfSmittyWerbenjagermanjensen/ComfyUI-Region-Genie"
      },
